# Project: Multi-Tenant E-Commerce SaaS Platform
## Complete Frontend Development & Product Experience

### 1. Your Role

Act as a Senior Product Designer, Senior Frontend Engineer, SaaS Architect, and E-commerce UX Specialist.

Your mission is to transform the existing project into a professional, production-quality, multi-tenant e-commerce SaaS platform.

This is not a simple e-commerce website.

We are building a platform that allows independent brands and businesses to create, customize, launch, and manage their own professional online stores without needing programming knowledge.

Think of the product as a combination of:
- Shopify: Store creation and customization.
- Amazon: Professional shopping experience and product discovery.
- Modern SaaS dashboards: Store management, analytics, and administration.

Use these products as functional and UX references, not as designs to copy.

**Primary objective: Build the complete frontend experience for all three user types, with a scalable architecture and a premium design system.**

The existing repository is an early prototype. Most of the product has not been implemented yet.

Do not assume that existing functionality is complete.

